{"id":1461490,"imdb":"tt17055444","en":"Hershey","orig":"Hershey","ar":null,"tag":"The true story of an American dreamer.","ov":"Based on the life of Milton Hershey, founder of the iconic Hershey chocolate company. Milton's grit and determination to conquer the world of candy-making propel him from bankruptcy to monumental success, and the love of his life, Kitty, helps him build a legacy sweeter than any candy bar. But when Kitty falls ill, Milton’s wild optimism teeters on the edge of destruction, and she sparks an even bolder dream: to leave their fortune in the hands of America’s children in need.","rd":"2026-11-25","rt":110,"g":[18,36,10749],"lang":"en","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Dandelion Media","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"Hershey Entities","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"Aloe Entertainment","logo":"/6Vk4WZnKJuC6z6HKBGFirbWwWwV.png","c":"US"},{"n":"Peachtree Group","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"RCM3","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"Angel Studios","logo":"/pDh2WDdOajWST9jlkFo6TOvETnB.png","c":"US"}],"countries":["US"],"langs":["English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"US","d":"2026-11-25"},{"c":"IL","d":"2027-01-14"},{"c":"BR","d":"2027-01-21"}],"dir":["Mark Waters"],"prod":["Sharon Paul","Mark Tilghman","Mary Aloe","Joshua Harris","Will Hardy"],"wri":["Timothy Michael Hayes","Sharon Paul"],"mus":["Rolfe Kent"],"dop":["Ed Wu"],"cast":[{"n":"Finn Wittrock","ch":"Milton Hershey","p":"/gwGMGTmli0uBF7eAhhXePWhYNFJ.jpg"},{"n":"Alexandra Daddario","ch":"Kitty Hershey","p":"/6qiLUZZYBE4FsrG8irWbb3I7P1n.jpg"},{"n":"Alan Ruck","ch":"Henry Hershey","p":"/hj7CuWinT12hMKjRhSO4XEMVq7w.jpg"},{"n":"Richard Kind","ch":"Joseph Royer","p":"/yWmuVQeQUzb5OSMVDoWkR0IylCK.jpg"},{"n":"David Costabile","ch":"Tobias Thornhill","p":"/jTouM1QK24TXy5Q3T40t4AhR8GH.jpg"},{"n":"Heléne Yorke","ch":"Margaret","p":"/ez1JE0OnbHpSJ9j7pybIHplozcP.jpg"},{"n":"Michael Moreland","ch":"Lebbie","p":"/yLPW1VGq3RbUURBKwRZU13lZBWb.jpg"},{"n":"Francesca Faridany","ch":"Fanny Hershey","p":"/fbXecW3S1MJMWWCIVgWWB3WcGf